02:08.000 --> 02:10.290
Nah, everyone was sleep deprived.

02:10.460 --> 02:13.460
I should've given better instructions, too.

02:13.540 --> 02:15.290
It doesn't matter who's fault it is!

02:15.580 --> 02:17.000
THIS is the problem!

02:15.670 --> 02:17.670
<b>JELEE listen and you'll die
JELEE cursed song</b>

02:17.750 --> 02:19.540
There's no way anyone would die!

02:19.540 --> 02:21.960
If anything, it's a song that gives life meaning!

02:22.380 --> 02:26.830
Still, at least it got us views.
It's a positive effect on the video overall.

02:26.830 --> 02:27.540
Blegh.

02:29.000 --> 02:31.130
That's true, I guess.

