14:24.540 --> 14:27.630
You know, Yoru. You're kind of a hassle sometimes.

14:27.630 --> 14:29.380
Wh-what's this all of a sudden?

14:29.580 --> 14:33.250
You act like you're all worldly
but you're actually pretty sensitive,

14:33.670 --> 14:38.420
and you look like you're mature when
you're actually kinda competitive.

14:39.380 --> 14:41.170
The kind of woman who's a hassle.

14:41.330 --> 14:42.710
