14:45.540 --> 14:47.580
Ooh! Jellyfish!

14:47.580 --> 14:48.290
Yeah.

14:50.750 --> 14:52.460
They're twinkling with light!

14:54.380 --> 14:56.630
Aquariums are so nice.

14:57.170 --> 14:58.130
They are.

14:58.920 --> 15:03.540
But you know, Shibuya, where
we first met doesn't have an aquarium.

15:03.830 --> 15:06.080
You're right. It doesn't.

15:06.710 --> 15:08.830
Hey, Kano. Make one.

15:10.080 --> 15:11.080
