15:11.460 --> 15:14.000
A big aquarium, right in Shibuya!

15:15.880 --> 15:16.630
Sure!

15:17.040 --> 15:18.250
Wait, I take it back!

15:18.250 --> 15:20.960
The way you say that makes me worry you'll actually try.

15:20.960 --> 15:24.080
I heard what you said! You can't take it back anymore!

15:24.080 --> 15:26.460
Once we get to 100k followers I'll do it for sure!

15:26.460 --> 15:28.330
Uh, 100k followers won't get you there.

15:33.380 --> 15:34.710
Then it's a promise.

15:34.710 --> 15:37.250
Fine, fine. I won't hold my breath, though.

15:41.380 --> 15:44.380
So listen, I decided on a goal for JELEE.

15:44.670 --> 15:45.420
