Three, two, one...

18:30.420 --> 18:32.880
Happy New Year!

18:33.830 --> 18:36.580
W-wow! We've already gotten 10k views!

18:36.960 --> 18:39.000
We're getting loads of comments, too!

18:39.000 --> 18:40.500
And so many likes!

18:40.960 --> 18:42.040
That's a relief.

18:43.040 --> 18:44.290
This is a first.

18:44.670 --> 18:45.420
Huh?

18:45.420 --> 18:50.750
It's a first! The first time we created
a hit video all on our own!

18:51.170 --> 18:53.380
Because the last one was cursed, huh?

18:53.580 --> 18:56.130
Though that one was a wonderful song, too.

18:56.130 --> 18:57.290
True.

18:59.880 --> 19:03.630
I wonder if I managed to shine, just a bit.

19:04.880 --> 19:06.920
<b>Hanazono
Shrine</b>

19:06.920 --> 19:08.670
<b>Fortune</b>

19:06.920 --> 19:08.670
<b>You will have: Great Luck</b>

19:06.920 --> 19:08.670
Whoa, I got "great luck"!

19:08.920 --> 19:11.040
Really? I got "moderate luck."

19:11.040 --> 19:12.460
I got "great luck," too.

19:12.460 --> 19:15.080
Maybe the fortune slips here are on the generous side.

19:15.080 --> 19:16.330
That's a thing?

19:16.330 --> 19:17.920
Hey, everyone!

19:18.130 --> 19:22.830
I got "bad luck"! It's not generous at all!

19:26.500 --> 19:28.040
Dear god, please listen.

19:28.580 --> 19:32.290
Up until now, I was always franticly
pushing ahead on my own.

19:32.290 --> 19:40.500
But now I have art I love, music I love, and music videos
I love with me to help deliver my singing.

19:40.920 --> 19:44.130
And so I have nothing left to pray for!

19:47.670 --> 19:51.080
You know, I've decided to start taking drawing classes.

19:51.460 --> 19:53.210
Huh! That's great!

19:53.710 --> 19:56.000
Then you found a reason to draw again.

19:56.380 --> 19:57.500
You think so?

19:58.330 --> 19:59.710
Maybe I did.

19:59.920 --> 20:00.670
Good!

20:01.580 --> 20:03.210
I'm off go buy some pork stew!

20:03.670 --> 20:05.170
Gonna eat my fill today!

20:05.170 --> 20:06.920
I'm not okay with this!

20:06.920 --> 20:08.750
I'm going to go draw another fortune!

20:10.420 --> 20:11.500
Such free spirits!

20:11.880 --> 20:14.250
We're all a bunch of oddballs.

20:14.710 --> 20:15.920
That's true.

20:15.920 --> 20:18.790
Out of the four of us, I think I might be the most sensible.

20:18.790 --> 20:20.920
Uh, that's clearly me, no matter how you look at it.

20:21.380 --> 20:23.000
I dunno about that!

20:26.420 --> 20:29.250
By the way, what did you pray for?

20:29.880 --> 20:31.960
Oh. Well...

20:32.580 --> 20:39.210
That I want to get better at drawing.
So that I can be confident about my art.

20:40.790 --> 20:41.830
I see!

20:42.130 --> 20:44.750
So I hope you'll bear with me.

20:45.250 --> 20:46.080
Of course!

20:48.880 --> 20:49.790
Yah!

20:57.290 --> 20:57.960
Huh?

20:59.580 --> 21:01.210
Ooh!

21:01.960 --> 21:05.380
I really like this jellyfish! It's a shame it'll disappear.

21:05.380 --> 21:06.130
Yah!

21:06.790 --> 21:07.880
Hey!

21:08.380 --> 21:09.880
Jeez. Me too!

21:09.880 --> 21:10.960
Whoa!

21:10.960 --> 21:11.960
Oh, come on!

21:19.040 --> 21:20.000
You know...

21:20.000 --> 21:20.380
Huh?

21:20.670 --> 21:24.000
I like your singing. And I like you too, Kano.

21:25.380 --> 21:27.630
Yoru, you sure you didn't drink too much amazake?

21:27.790 --> 21:30.040
Oh who cares? It's New Year's!

21:31.670 --> 21:38.250
See, I realized I never told you this directly, so here goes.

21:38.250 --> 21:39.000
Yeah?

21:39.210 --> 21:43.040
Thank you for giving me the chance to draw again.

21:47.290 --> 21:48.040
Huh?!

21:50.130 --> 21:53.330
J-jeez! Don't get carried away in the moment like that!

21:59.290 --> 22:02.380
Okay, I'm gonna go get myself some pork stew, too!

22:18.630 --> 22:22.000
<b>Shibuya
Aquarium
Kimura
Yoru Umitsuki
Nox Ryugasaki</b>

22:24.500 --> 22:31.380
Mugen ni hirogatta machi no akari o nagamete itara

22:24.500 --> 22:31.380
