22:31.380 --> 22:38.250
Jibun ga inakutatte nani mo kawaranai kiga shichau kedo

22:31.380 --> 22:38.250
It might make it seem like you don't make a difference at all

22:38.460 --> 22:44.750
Demo kimi ga inakya kono uta o utatte inai kara

22:38.460 --> 22:44.750
But without you I wouldn't be singing this song

22:44.750 --> 22:51.500
Sukoshi no aida kiitete hoshiinda

22:44.750 --> 22:51.500
So I want you to listen for just a while

22:52.960 --> 22:57.500
Souda, hitotsu dake yakusoku shiyou yo kitto kanaeru yo

22:52.960 --> 22:57.500
I know, I'll promise you one thing - I swear I'll make it happen

22:57.500 --> 23:03.080
Kono machi o itsuka kuragetachi ga oyogi mawaru

22:57.500 --> 23:03.080
Someday jellyfish will swim around this town

23:03.080 --> 23:06.460
Otogibanashi mitai na yume o

23:03.080 --> 23:06.460
A dream that's like a fairy tale

23:06.630 --> 23:12.540
Kimi dake ni shika nai iro de saa, egaite yo

23:06.630 --> 23:12.540
Now draw it for me in colors all your own

23:12.710 --> 23:19.710
Sono mayoi mo ai mo zenbu suisou ni ukabeyouka

23:12.710 --> 23:19.710
Those anxieties and sorrows, shall we float them all in an aquarium?

23:19.880 --> 23:26.330
Nee, kesshite kirei na iro bakari janakute iiyo

23:19.880 --> 23:26.330
Hey, it's okay if the colors aren't all pretty

23:26.330 --> 23:32.880
Dare nimo mienai youni chiisana hikari tomosu

23:26.330 --> 23:32.880
Even if the light shines so small no one sees

23:32.880 --> 23:39.500
Sonna yoru ga watashi wa suki da

23:32.880 --> 23:39.500
That's the night I love
